<!-- Final Call to Action -->
<!-- Questions are part of learning -->
<section class="section" style="background:#fff">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="section-hdr center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Before you choose a course</span>
      <h2>Questions are part of learning</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Which course is right for me?</summary>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">If you're new to requirements engineering, CPRE Foundation is the clearest starting point. If your work is broader, begin with the path finder and we'll recommend a level.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Can I learn around a full-time job?</summary>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Yes. Upcoming cohort pages show the complete schedule, session length and time zone before you register.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Do I need experience to start?</summary>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Most foundation courses are designed for motivated beginners and working professionals. Each course page explains the recommended background.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq-item" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What training delivery modes are available?</summary>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
          <div>
            <p style="margin:0;font-weight:600"><span aria-hidden="true">🔴</span> Live</p>
            <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0">Learn with a practitioner in real time. Ask questions, practise with examples and get feedback.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin:0;font-weight:600"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Recorded</p>
            <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0">Learn at your own pace with recorded lessons and supporting materials.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin:0;font-weight:600"><span aria-hidden="true">↔</span> Hybrid</p>
            <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0">Combine self-paced learning with live sessions for the best of both worlds.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted)">Still have a question? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="cta-band-bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
